{"1311560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drone Zone", "steam_appid": 1311560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 Steam Next Fest Participant</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drone Zone is part of Steam Next Fest! <br>Download the demo and experience dynamic 5v5 battles with real-time drone progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version launches in April 2026 — add the game to your wishlist so you don’t miss the release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/408e2835a64744d54dd9a2e10ac69d74.avif?t=1772025237\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ACTIVE ABILITIES</strong> <br>Each drone has a set of active abilities. Immobilize enemies with an energy burst, deploy a field that blocks incoming attacks, summon an anomaly on your target, and use many other powerful skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/c65ab4147b20ca1934043802900901be.poster.avif?t=1772025237\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/c65ab4147b20ca1934043802900901be.webm?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/c65ab4147b20ca1934043802900901be.mp4?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5v5 TEAM BATTLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drone Zone is a tactical team-based online shooter with in-match progression and abilities. Teams of 5 fight to destroy the enemy base or eliminate all opposing drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/b4e3a84eb50a2ba0a3d41be937ea006c.poster.avif?t=1772025237\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/b4e3a84eb50a2ba0a3d41be937ea006c.webm?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/b4e3a84eb50a2ba0a3d41be937ea006c.mp4?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IN-MATCH PROGRESSION</strong> <br>Earn experience by defeating enemies and capturing resource nodes. Level up during the match to increase damage, health, and upgrade your drone’s abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/6d2519f13fcf90a52f91d81e4942a1fc.poster.avif?t=1772025237\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/6d2519f13fcf90a52f91d81e4942a1fc.webm?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/6d2519f13fcf90a52f91d81e4942a1fc.mp4?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOOST YOUR DRONE WITH BATTLE SHOP ITEMS</strong> <br>In addition to leveling up, you can strengthen your drone by purchasing items with gold earned in battle—boost damage, gain healing effects, reflect damage, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/f890e7dfbe49670d4bad2b3a0040bed0.poster.avif?t=1772025237\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/f890e7dfbe49670d4bad2b3a0040bed0.webm?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/f890e7dfbe49670d4bad2b3a0040bed0.mp4?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TACTICAL FIREFIGHTS</strong> <br>Destroy enemy modules to limit their strengths. Take out an engine to ground a drone or disable its weapon to stop it from firing. Protect your own modules from enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/78ff2c16af2a887195373ac2edd2a085.poster.avif?t=1772025237\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/78ff2c16af2a887195373ac2edd2a085.webm?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/78ff2c16af2a887195373ac2edd2a085.mp4?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRONE ASSEMBLY</strong> <br>Use gathered resources to craft engines, weapons, batteries, and other modules. Combine them to build your own unique drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/e7c8ca92ace963da76228d7cc5720ec7.avif?t=1772025237\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 Steam Next Fest Participant</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drone Zone is part of Steam Next Fest! <br>Download the demo and experience dynamic 5v5 battles with real-time drone progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version launches in April 2026 — add the game to your wishlist so you don’t miss the release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/408e2835a64744d54dd9a2e10ac69d74.avif?t=1772025237\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ACTIVE ABILITIES</strong> <br>Each drone has a set of active abilities. Immobilize enemies with an energy burst, deploy a field that blocks incoming attacks, summon an anomaly on your target, and use many other powerful skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/c65ab4147b20ca1934043802900901be.poster.avif?t=1772025237\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/c65ab4147b20ca1934043802900901be.webm?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/c65ab4147b20ca1934043802900901be.mp4?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5v5 TEAM BATTLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drone Zone is a tactical team-based online shooter with in-match progression and abilities. Teams of 5 fight to destroy the enemy base or eliminate all opposing drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/b4e3a84eb50a2ba0a3d41be937ea006c.poster.avif?t=1772025237\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"htt